    &none             &bt BT_SEL 0      &bt BT_SEL 1      &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_SEL 3          &none                 &kp C_PREVIOUS    &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN &kp C_VOLUME_UP   &kp C_NEXT        &none             &none       
